OL,4,B'Somebody has to stand up to that guy' 
OL,5,B- Verstappen-Russell rivalry blows up  
OL,6,Bagain                                  
OL,7,GThe Las Vegas Grand Prix will start    
OL,8,Gwith two drivers on the front row who  
OL,9,Gdislike each other - and after         
OL,10,Gqualifying one said of the other that  
OL,11,G"somebody has got to stand up to that  
OL,12,Gguy".                                  
OL,14,F"That guy" is Max Verstappen, who      
OL,15,Fstarts his Red Bull from pole          
OL,16,Fposition. The driver criticising him   
OL,17,Fis Mercedes' George Russell, who lines 
OL,18,Fup second.                             
